  m_text: "Review Chuck Setup Video and then return to this guide \n\n\n\n\n\nChuck
    insertion is a two-handed operation. \n\n\nWith your Left Hand : Hold the Chuck
    and insert into the blue chuck zone under the quill and lightly push up on the
    chuck.\n\nWith your Right Hand : Pushing the quill handle back until the chuck
    locks into place\n"
